@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
actor "居民/商户" as U
participant "Web客服界面" as Web
participant "FastAPI" as API
database "SQLite/MySQL" as DB
actor "运营管理员/人工客服" as A
U -> Web: 提交咨询（分类、主题、内容）
Web -> API: POST /api/support/tickets (JWT)
API -> API: 检查登录角色并校验参数
API -> DB: 事务写入SupportTicket + SupportMessage
DB --> API: 工单#ID
API --> Web: 201 + 工单信息
A -> API: GET /api/support/tickets (JWT)
API -> DB: 查询全部工单
DB --> API: 工单列表
A -> API: POST /api/support/tickets/{id}/messages
API -> DB: 保存管理员回复 + 置IN_PROGRESS
A -> API: PATCH /api/support/tickets/{id}/status RESOLVED
API -> DB: 更新状态
U -> API: GET /api/support/tickets/{id}
API -> API: 仅所有者或管理员可访问
API -> DB: 查询消息与状态
API --> U: 工单及消息记录
@enduml
